   = help: `session` is a carrier and this signature writes no clause, so its contract is `where borrows(session)`
   = help: part of the value comes from `tag`, which `where borrows(session), carries(tag)` would permit; the rest no clause can
   = help: `rebuilt` belongs to `first` and ends when it returns, so nothing returned may observe it
   = help: an owned copy observes nothing and needs no clause: declare `String` where the result holds the view, and store `….to_owned()` there, which copies the text and can fail with `mem.Oom`
   = help: the types this names are reached with `import std.mem`
